        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SOSS 203C, Invisible Door Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSOSS 203 hinges are for use on 3/4\" thick wood doors or metal doors. Package includes one pair of hinges with matching finish  #6 x 1\"  wood screws. When the door is closed, SOSS Invisible Hinges cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-7.jpg?v=1704354530\" width=\"251\" height=\"322\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SOSS 203 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available For: <a href=\"/products/1-inch-thick-door-invisible-door-hinges-soss-208\"><b>1\" Thick Doors SOSS 208 Hinge</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/invisible-door-hinge-for-1-3-4-inch-thick-doors-soss-218\"><b>1-3/4\" Thick Doors SOSS 218 Hinge</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/1-3-8-thick-door-invisible-door-hinge-soss-216\"><b>1-3/8\" Thick Doors SOSS 216 Hinge</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/2-inch-thick-door-invisible-door-hinge-soss-220\"><b>2\" Thick Doors SOSS 220 Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Concealed Cabinet Door Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For use on wood or metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Hinges open a full 180°</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SOSS 203 Invisible Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: High Strength Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Plate Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: <b>3/4\" Thick Door</b></li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #6x1\" (3.5x25mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold In Pairs (2 Door Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
